<title>USA: Salomon names Leat to high yield debt group.</title>
<headline>Salomon names Leat to high yield debt group.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Inc said it named Chad Leat managing director in its High Yield Capital Markets Group.</p>
<p>Leat, formerly of Chase Manhattan Corp, will handle fixed-income financing for financial buyer clients and manage the firm's bridge loan fund, Salomon said.</p>
<p>Leat had led Chase's loan syndication business. Chase had no immediate comment on who would replace him.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
